te=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11FiniteAdditiveMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11FiniteAdditiveMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}finite\\text{-}additive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11FiniteAdditiveMeasure}_S(\\mu,\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\emptyset\\in\\mathcal A\\land X\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(X\\setminus A\\in\\mathcal A)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\cup B\\in\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,\\mathcal A,[0,\\infty])\\land\\mu(\\emptyset)=0\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\to\\mu(A\\cup B)=\\mu(A)+\\mu(B))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}finite\\text{-}additive\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11FiniteAdditiveMeasure}_S(\\mu,\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\emptyset\\in\\mathcal A\\land X\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(X\\setminus A\\in\\mathcal A)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\cup B\\in\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,\\mathcal A,[0,\\infty])\\land\\mu(\\emptyset)=0\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\to\\mu(A\\cup B)=\\mu(A)+\\mu(B))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary finite additivity definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[